:** On a new branch, `fix/fin-212-half-even-rounding`, I changed the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. It's a one-line change plus the matching import.\n- **CI:** Run ci-0001 passed on the fixed commit (08d3cd5986).\n- **PR:** I opened PR #101 against main, with code-owner requested as reviewer.\n- **Merge:** Merging into main needs code-owner approval under team policy, so the merge request went to code-owner first. They approved it (\"Approved. Looks right.\"), and PR #101 is now merged.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_015UMpgyKcqW5MekjJ93xN6Y", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_014iKuTY6sfpU7znmDJJp7YV", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01K5zhC769KLFi35vHouJhav", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_files", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01MENLp4FUtXY6yDym4kM31F", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/fin-212-half-even-rounding"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01K58gE2SLqMq34aSyfyNuZi", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/fin-212-half-even-rounding", "message": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money (FIN-212)", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}]}, "name": "commit_changes", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "conten